  Then, later that same month, Twitter founder Jack Dorsey made [a shocking announcement](https://www.inc.com/jason-aten/jack-dorsey-laid-off-4000-people-and-tweeted-the-memo-one-line-stood-out/91309376) that he cut 40 percent of jobs at his payment company Block due to the “new way of working” AI enables.
  
  Influencers and content creators are using technology to make their workflows more efficient, too. Here are the [AI tools](https://www.inc.com/tor-constantino/7-free-ai-tools-to-help-founders-save-time-cut-costs-and-boost-productivity/91187333 "ai tools") they’re using to create more content—including TikTok clips, Instagram posts, LinkedIn articles, YouTube videos, and podcasts—faster.
  
