  ## Captions & Effects Tools
  
  Captions are non-negotiable on TikTok. [85% of TikTok videos are watched with sound off](https://www.oberlo.com/statistics/tiktok-statistics), and the algorithm favors videos with high watch time — captions keep people watching. These tools make captioning fast and visually engaging.
  
