  **Best for:** One-tap animated captions that match TikTok trends
  
  [Captions](https://www.captions.ai/) (formerly known as Captions AI) is the most popular dedicated caption tool among TikTok creators. It adds animated, word-by-word subtitles that keep viewers engaged and watching longer.
  
  **Key TikTok Features:**
  
  - AI-generated animated captions in trending styles
  - AI Eye Contact correction (keeps eyes on camera even when reading)
  - Audio enhancement and noise removal
  - AI Dubbing for multi-language TikToks
